{"id":"91493cff84d506fb","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-sat-time-space-tradeoff.md","title":"SAT的联合时间空间下界","display":"thm-sat-time-space-tradeoff — SAT的联合时间空间下界","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-sat-time-space-tradeoff","aliases":["28-thm-sat-time-space-tradeoff"],"display":"thm-sat-time-space-tradeoff — SAT的联合时间空间下界","depends_on":["[[28-df-tisp]]","[[28-df-sat]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach; Theorem 5.11","source_printed_pages":"101–102","source_pdf_pages":"127–128","source_status":"statement-compared-proof-not-fully-reviewed","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-sat-time-space-tradeoff"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-sat-time-space-tradeoff</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-sat-time-space-tradeoff — SAT的联合时间空间下界"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e7acf5d437592730\" href=\"?note=e7acf5d437592730\" title=\"28-df-tisp\">28-df-tisp</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4041cfa2975b8dd1\" href=\"?note=4041cfa2975b8dd1\" title=\"28-df-sat\">28-df-sat</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach; Theorem 5.11"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"101–102"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"127–128"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-proof-not-fully-reviewed"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SAT}\">\\(\\mathrm{SAT}\\)</span> 是本目录固定显式公式编码的可满足性语言，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4041cfa2975b8dd1\" href=\"?note=4041cfa2975b8dd1\" title=\"28-df-sat\">28-df-sat</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TISP}\">\\(\\mathrm{TISP}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e7acf5d437592730\" href=\"?note=e7acf5d437592730\" title=\"28-df-tisp\">28-df-tisp</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SAT}\\notin\\mathrm{TISP}\\left(n\\mapsto\\lceil(n+2)^{11/10}\\rceil,\\ n\\mapsto\\lceil(n+2)^{1/10}\\rceil\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{SAT}\\notin\\mathrm{TISP}\\left(n\\mapsto\\lceil(n+2)^{11/10}\\rceil,\\ n\\mapsto\\lceil(n+2)^{1/10}\\rceil\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>精确对应原书n<sup>{1.1}时间与n</sup>{0.1}空间的同一机器下界；n+2和取整仅处理短输入。原书证明依赖近线性Cook–Levin归约、时间换交替及非确定型层级。此次比对陈述和这条依赖链，没有完整核验近线性归约，禁止升级为已核验依赖。</p>\n<p>来源：用户所给 Arora–Barak PDF，Theorem 5.11；印刷 pp.101–102 / PDF pp.127–128。本次核对范围：对应陈述；证明边界见本节，未升级为完整证明核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-tisp","status":"resolved","id":"e7acf5d437592730","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-tisp]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-sat","status":"resolved","id":"4041cfa2975b8dd1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-sat]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-sat","status":"resolved","id":"4041cfa2975b8dd1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SAT}$ 是本目录固定显式公式编码的可满足性语言，见 [[28-df-sat]]；$\\mathrm{TISP}$ 见 [[28-df-tisp]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-tisp","status":"resolved","id":"e7acf5d437592730","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SAT}$ 是本目录固定显式公式编码的可满足性语言，见 [[28-df-sat]]；$\\mathrm{TISP}$ 见 [[28-df-tisp]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{SAT}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TISP}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SAT}\\notin\\mathrm{TISP}\\left(n\\mapsto\\lceil(n+2)^{11/10}\\rceil,\\ n\\mapsto\\lceil(n+2)^{1/10}\\rceil\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1488,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-291","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-tisp]]、[[28-thm-sat-time-space-tradeoff]]、[[28-prop-ph-complement-duality]]、[[28-prop-ph-level-inclusions]]。"}],"outgoing":["e7acf5d437592730","4041cfa2975b8dd1"]}